<title>HUNGARY: CESI drops to end at 1,468.10 points.</title>
<headline>CESI drops to end at 1,468.10 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index dropped 8.52 points or 0.58 percent to 1,468.10 points, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
